<i>I decided to spend some time 
enjoying this sweet, insane world.</i>

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:29.650
Welcome—

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:30.740
Good evening!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:32.470
You're energetic, huh?

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:33.220
Come inside.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.690
Th-Thank you!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.440
So this is your room, Doi-senpai?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.890
Who's that?

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.460
Oh, don't worry about her.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.980
She's basically a pet.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:48.000
Oh, your boyfriend, Takamatsu-kun.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:52.660
Did he die from the virus? 
Or is he in cold sleep?

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.480
I don't know.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:59.460
Well, I don't care if that 
idiot's alive or dead.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:03.460
I'm just happy the world changed.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.200
You're still mad about something 
that happened five years ago?

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.710
Get over it!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.700
It was five years ago to you,

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.350
but to me it wasn't that long ago at all!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.110
You're cute. Unlike that thing.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.370
Senpai, I'm embarrassed!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.450
Nobody's looking.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.390
You look like you're in pain.

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:53.960
Please, give me some drugs...

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:57.240
You were a drug addict in 
the slums, weren't you?

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.520
You should get that treated.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.650
I've got the medicine for it right here.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:06.560
Please! Give me the medicine...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.290
Don't make that face. 
I'll give it to you now.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:18.040
Here. You want it, right?

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:34.620
Goodnight.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.800
<i>This world is filled with lies.</i>

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.500
<i>The hospital where the virus 
researchers disappeared...</i>

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.340
<i>Erisa was researching the MK Virus, too.</i>

00:21:57.340 --> 00:21:59.960
<i>Maybe I'll find her there...</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Feast of Debauchery</b>
